invariant: INV-14
file: webpki_cfg.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: a TRUST=webpki client with anchors takes a clock that answers 0,
  an unset clock, and the handshake it starts fails later with CH_EAUTH at
  the certificate dates instead of CH_EINVAL at init.
  bin/webpki_session_test's row of a clock that answers 0 objects.

--- old
    return pins_alone(cfg) || now_seconds != 0;
--- new
    (void)cfg;
    (void)now_seconds;
    return 1;
